{"time_ns": 1794070824454033000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 14, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "f582ad9a91337d2e1dac7e618b742a76087cd1134970bbc9b192c53bdfbbda3c", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report presents a summary of financial records aggregated by geographic region. The analysis processes 24 records spanning three regions: North, South, and West.\n\n## Data Summary\n- **Total Records Processed:** 24 (R001 through R024)\n- **Total Amount:** 1,136,860 cents ($11,368.60)\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n### North Region\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n- **Total Amount:** 420,201 cents ($4,202.01)\n- **Records:** R001, R004, R007, R010, R013, R016, R019, R022\n\n### South Region\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n- **Total Amount:** 292,437 cents ($2,924.37)\n- **Records:** R002, R005, R008, R011, R014, R017, R020, R023\n\n### West Region\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n- **Total Amount:** 424,222 cents ($4,242.22)\n- **Records:** R003, R006, R009, R012, R015, R018, R021, R024\n\n## Conclusion\nThe analysis is complete with all 24 records accounted for. The West region shows the highest total amount, followed by the North region, with the South region representing the lowest total. Each region contains exactly 8 records, reflecting a balanced distribution across the three geographic areas.\n", "ok": true}
